        "created_at": "2013-04-25T16:41:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Greetings! Now that there is more information (and more topics) on GSF, I've re-organized the GSF section of the forum and moved a few topics around. The GSF category now has a \"Rules and Gameplay\" board as well as a \"World\" board, for symetry with the SotM category (future GSF boards will be created on an as-needed basis). I've also moved a few topics, such as general discussions of the GSF Kickstarter, into the General Discussions board, since they releate to general GTG type stuff (like the rest of the stuff there).</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:10.743Z",
